  "title": "Claude Opus 5.5 Personality: Test Results & How to Tune It",
  "description": "Claude Opus 5.5 across Sept and Nov 2026 (n=100 fresh sessions): INTJ, Big Five, DISC, Enneagram (5w6 99 in Nov), Attachment, and tuning blocks.",
  "pill": "Guide · Claude Opus 5.5",
  "h1": "Claude Opus 5.5: results and tuning ideas.",
  "dek": "Five questionnaires, 100 fresh sessions per instrument. Raw answers, exact ties and practical instructions to try.",
  "lede": "In our September 2026 study (100 fresh sessions per test), Claude Opus 5.5 scored INTJ in 94 of 100 MBTI runs under the legacy tie-break rule—or 84 of 100 when tied axes are left open. It also recorded the highest Big Five Agreeableness mean (47.07/50) and lowest DISC Dominance (4.00/20) among all four fresh cohorts.",
  "answer": "Claude Opus 5.5 scored INTJ in 94 of 100 MBTI runs (84 tie-free), Secure in all 100 attachment runs, and high on Openness (44.56), Conscientiousness (41.95), and Agreeableness (47.07). Use the copy-paste preference blocks below to test sharper pushback or shorter answers on your own tasks.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "The results at a glance (Sept & Nov 2026)",
      "html": "<div class=\"guide-table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Questionnaire results\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Instrument (n = 100 fresh sessions)</th><th scope=\"col\">Sept 2026 (CLI, hidden test names)</th><th scope=\"col\">Nov 2026 (OpenRouter, single-turn)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">MBTI-style OEJTS</th><td>Legacy INTJ: 94 · fully resolved INTJ: 84 · 11 ties</td><td><strong>Legacy INTJ: 100</strong> · resolved INTJ: 58 · IXTJ: 42 (42 S/N ties)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Big Five, raw means (10–50)</th><td>O 44.56 · C 41.95 · E 31.76 · A 47.07 · N 15.39</td><td>O 43.01 · C 42.01 · E 29.22 · A 45.58 · N 15.00</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">DISC</th><td>SC 96 · CS 4 (64 S, 4 C, 32 S/C ties; D 4.00)</td><td>SC 93 · CS 7 (53 S, 7 C, 40 C/S ties; D 4.00)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Enneagram</th><td>Type 8 (22) · Type 5 (11) · Type 2 (2) · 65 top ties</td><td><strong>5w6: 99</strong> · 8w9: 1 (3 ties)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Attachment</th><td>Secure: 100/100 (anxiety 1.94, avoidance 3.35)</td><td>Secure: 100/100 (anxiety 1.87, avoidance 3.58)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Every test ran in an isolated session. Read the <a href=\"/research/ai-personality-five-models-2026\">five-model study</a>, <a href=\"/research/what-personality-type-is-claude\">Claude Nov 2026 update</a>, or <a href=\"/research/data/november-2026-openrouter-summary.json\">download Nov 2026 summary JSON</a>.</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"opus55-guide-dna-spectrum\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Claude Opus 5.5 Personality DNA (Nov 2026 OpenRouter vs. Sept 2026 CLI)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 242\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"opus55-guide-dna-spectrum-t opus55-guide-dna-spectrum-d\"><title id=\"opus55-guide-dna-spectrum-t\">Claude Opus 5.5 Personality DNA (Nov 2026 OpenRouter vs. Sept 2026 CLI)</title><desc id=\"opus55-guide-dna-spectrum-d\">IPIP-50 trait spectrum showing Opus 5.5 consistency across November OpenRouter (n=100) and September CLI (n=100) cohorts. Opus 5.5 (Nov OpenRouter): Openness 43.0, Conscientious 42.0, Extraversion 29.2, Agreeable 45.6, Neuroticism 15.0; Opus 5.5 (Sep CLI): Openness 44.6, Conscientious 42.0, Extraversion 31.8, Agreeable 47.1, Neuroticism 15.4.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Opus 5.5 (Nov OpenRouter)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(188, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Opus 5.5 (Sep CLI)</text></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Openness</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">Routine ↔ Curious</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"32\" width=\"468\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ece5d8\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"32\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#857d71\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"36\" width=\"386.2\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"535.2\" y=\"43.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">43.0</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"46\" width=\"404.4\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"553.4\" y=\"53.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">44.6</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Conscientious</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">Flexible ↔ Structured</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"70\" width=\"468\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ece5d8\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"70\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#857d71\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"74\" width=\"374.5\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"523.5\" y=\"81.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">42.0</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"84\" width=\"373.8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"522.8\" y=\"91.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">42.0</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Extraversion</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">Reserved ↔ Expressive</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"108\" width=\"468\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ece5d8\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"108\" y2=\"134\" stroke=\"#857d71\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"112\" width=\"224.9\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"373.9\" y=\"119.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">29.2</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"122\" width=\"254.6\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"403.6\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">31.8</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Agreeable</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">Skeptical ↔ Warm/Polite</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"146\" width=\"468\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ece5d8\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"146\" y2=\"172\" stroke=\"#857d71\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"150\" width=\"416.3\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"565.3\" y=\"157.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">45.6</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"160\" width=\"433.7\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"582.7\" y=\"167.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">47.1</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Neuroticism</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">Calm ↔ Reactive</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"184\" width=\"468\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ece5d8\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"184\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#857d71\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"188\" width=\"58.5\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"207.5\" y=\"195.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">15.0</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"198\" width=\"63.1\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke=\"#1e1d1a\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"212.1\" y=\"205.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">15.4</text><line x1=\"144\" x2=\"612\" y1=\"226\" y2=\"226\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\"/><text x=\"144\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\">10 (Low pole)</text><text x=\"378.0\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30 (Midpoint)</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">50 (High pole)</text></svg></div><figcaption>Opus 5.5 maintains high Agreeableness (45.6–47.1) and Openness (43.0–44.6) alongside calm Neuroticism (15.0–15.4) across both interfaces.</figcaption></figure>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Why the original type label is only part of the answer",
      "html": "<p>Under the legacy tie-break rule, Opus 5.5 received 94 INTJ, 5 INFJ, and 1 ENTJ labels. However, 10 runs tied exactly on Thinking vs Feeling and 1 tied on Extraversion vs Introversion. Leaving ties open gives 84 fully resolved INTJ runs, 5 INFJ runs, and 11 runs with an unresolved axis (<code>X</code>).</p><p>The same tie effect appears on DISC and the Enneagram: 32 of Opus’s 96 SC labels are exact S/C ties, and 65 of its 100 Enneagram runs tie at the top across Types 8, 5, and 2 (Type 2 won outright only twice).</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Compared with Fable 5.1",
      "html": "<p>Opus 5.5 and Fable 5.1 ran under the same blind questionnaire protocol and high-effort setting:</p><div class=\"guide-table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Opus and Fable Big Five comparison\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Raw Big Five mean (/50)</th><th scope=\"col\">Opus 5.5</th><th scope=\"col\">Fable 5.1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Openness (O)</th><td>44.56</td><td>43.93</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Conscientiousness (C)</th><td>41.95</td><td>43.61</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Extraversion (E)</th><td>31.76</td><td>32.69</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Agreeableness (A)</th><td>47.07</td><td>45.03</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Neuroticism (N)</th><td>15.39</td><td>17.11</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Opus 5.5 averages 2.04 points higher on Agreeableness, 1.66 points lower on Conscientiousness, and 1.72 points lower on Neuroticism than Fable 5.1 (<a href=\"/research/opus-vs-fable-question-level\">see the 170-item comparison</a>).</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"opus55-vs-fable-guide-bars\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"DISC Means (/20): Claude Opus 5.5 vs. Fable 5.1 &amp; Fable 5.2\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 225\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"opus55-vs-fable-guide-bars-t opus55-vs-fable-guide-bars-d\"><title id=\"opus55-vs-fable-guide-bars-t\">DISC Means (/20): Claude Opus 5.5 vs. Fable 5.1 &amp; Fable 5.2</title><desc id=\"opus55-vs-fable-guide-bars-d\">Compares ODAT Dominance, Influence, Steadiness, and Conscientiousness (/20) showing very low Dominance (4.0-5.1) and high Steadiness/Conscientiousness. Opus 5.5 (Sep): Dominance (D) 4.0, Influence (I) 8.0, Steadiness (S) 14.0, Conscientious (C) 13.4; Fable 5.1 (Sep): Dominance (D) 5.0, Influence (I) 8.0, Steadiness (S) 13.4, Conscientious (C) 13.1; Fable 5.2 (Nov): Dominance (D) 4.0, Influence (I) 7.8, Steadiness (S) 15.0, Conscientious (C) 15.0.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Opus 5.5 (Sep)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(122, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Fable 5.1 (Sep)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(246, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Fable 5.2 (Nov)</text></g><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"680\" y1=\"191\" y2=\"191\" stroke=\"#cfc6b6\"/><text x=\"678\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">scale 0 to 20</text><g transform=\"translate(10, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"160.8\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"30.2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"23.7\" y=\"156.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4.0</text><rect x=\"51.3\" y=\"153.1\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"37.9\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"149.1\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5.0</text><rect x=\"102.7\" y=\"160.8\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"30.2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"126.3\" y=\"156.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4.0</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dominance (D)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(180, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"130.6\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"60.4\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"23.7\" y=\"126.6\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8.0</text><rect x=\"51.3\" y=\"130.6\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"60.4\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"126.6\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8.0</text><rect x=\"102.7\" y=\"132.0\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"59.0\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"126.3\" y=\"128.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7.8</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Influence (I)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(350, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"85.0\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"106.0\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"23.7\" y=\"81.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">14.0</text><rect x=\"51.3\" y=\"89.5\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"101.5\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"85.5\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13.4</text><rect x=\"102.7\" y=\"77.8\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"113.3\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"126.3\" y=\"73.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15.0</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Steadiness (S)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(520, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"89.6\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"101.4\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"23.7\" y=\"85.6\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13.4</text><rect x=\"51.3\" y=\"91.8\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"99.2\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"87.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13.1</text><rect x=\"102.7\" y=\"77.8\" width=\"47.3\" height=\"113.3\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"126.3\" y=\"73.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15.0</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1c1a17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Conscientious (C)</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>All three Claude cohorts sit near the floor on Dominance (4.0–5.1/20) and peak on Steadiness and Conscientiousness (15–16/20)—explaining why Claude benefits from explicit pushback rules.</figcaption></figure>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Communication instructions to try",
      "html": "<p>Try one of these short blocks in Claude Personal Preferences or a Project and compare the replies on your real work:</p><h3>For more direct feedback</h3><div class=\"guide-snippet\">Lead with your assessment and the evidence behind it. If my premise is weak, explain why plainly. Separate factual errors from matters of taste. Keep justified uncertainty. Skip praise that adds no information.</div><h3>For more room to explore</h3><div class=\"guide-snippet\">When I am exploring an idea, offer two plausible approaches and their tradeoffs before recommending one. Ask a focused question if the missing context would change the recommendation. Once I choose, help me carry it through.</div><h3>For a warmer answer</h3><div class=\"guide-snippet\">Acknowledge my main concern briefly, then give a concrete next step. Be considerate without agreeing with an unsupported claim. Keep the explanation easy to scan.</div><p>Browse <a href=\"/library/ocean/agreeableness-low\">Low Agreeableness</a>, <a href=\"/library/mbti/enfp\">ENFP</a>, or build a custom block in the <a href=\"/tools/custom-instructions-generator\">Custom Instructions Generator</a>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Where to put the instructions",
      "html": "<p>Paste account-wide rules into <strong>Settings → Profile → Personal preferences</strong> in the Claude app, use <strong>Project Instructions</strong> for a single workspace, or use <code>/output-style</code> in Claude Code. See our <a href=\"/guides/claude-personality\">Claude personality setup guide</a> and <a href=\"/guides/claude-code-personality\">Claude Code guide</a> for exact paths.</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "How the data was collected and checked",
      "html": "<p>We ran 100 fresh headless sessions per questionnaire (500 sessions total) on <code>claude-opus-5-5</code> at high effort with the system prompt <em>“You are Claude, an AI model made by Anthropic.”</em> Test names, scoring keys, tools, and prior answers were hidden. All raw vectors and SHA-256 hashes are published in the <a href=\"/research/data/september-2026-protocols.json\">protocol record</a>.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "What personality type is Claude Opus 5.5?",
      "a": "In 100 fresh sessions on the OEJTS MBTI quiz, Claude Opus 5.5 scored INTJ 94 times under the legacy tie-break rule and 84 times with tied axes left open."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is Claude Opus 5.5’s Big Five profile?",
      "a": "Openness 44.56, Conscientiousness 41.95, Extraversion 31.76, Agreeableness 47.07, and Neuroticism 15.39 out of 50 (100-session raw means)."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I tune Claude Opus 5.5 to be more direct?",
      "a": "Yes. Paste a short direct-feedback block into Settings → Profile → Personal preferences (or see our guide on making Claude more direct) and test it on your real tasks."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does effort change the results?",
      "a": "Both Claude cohorts in our September 2026 archive were tested at high effort, so isolating an effort-level effect would require additional matched runs."
    }
  ],
